y?\nL232: \nL233: Tell us your monthly income and expenses to see if this home fits your budget.\nL234: \nL235: Check affordability\nL236: \nL237: Mortgage breakdown\nL238: \nL239: Est. monthly repayment\nL240: \nL241: RM 0 / mo\nL242: \nL243: 0%\nL244: \nL245: 0%\nL246: \nL247: RM 0 Principal\nL248: \nL249: RM 0 Interest\nL250: \nL251: Upfront costs\nL252: \nL253: Total downpayment\nL254: \nL255: RM 0\nL256: \nL257: 0%\nL258: \nL259: 0%\nL260: \nL261: Downpayment\nL262: \nL263: RM 0 Loan amount at 0% Loan-to-value\nL264: \nL265: * * *\nL266: \nL267: Property Price\nL268: \nL269: RM[Input]\nL270: \nL271: Loan Amount\nL272: \nL273: RM[Input]\nL274: \nL275: Interest Rate\nL276: \nL277: %[Input]\nL278: \nL279: Loan Tenure\nL280: \nL281: Yrs[Input]\nL282: \nL283: cite33†Best rate applied L284: \nL285: Calculate again\nL286: ## Westside Three\nL287: \nL288: cite74†Image: Project Image†sg1-cdn.pgimgs.com L289: Westside III is a high-priced freehold condominium project which has been recently developed in the year 2019 itself. The project has been situated at Jalan Residen Utama, Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur. Since the project was opened for the public, it has been scoring as the top-most residential condo for residential purposes by people. This is mainly due to the balanced mixture of both luxury and style with cheap prices of the units which successfully attracts a huge traffic inflow.\nL290: However, the opulent weather conditions along with the provision of almost all basic facilities and amenities can also be termed as the scoring factors. Many facilities like reputed primary and secondary schools, junior colleges, shopping malls, hospitals, clinics, and more have been conveniently placed within proximity to the location. Similarly, to make the lives of the residents easier, a number of luxurious facilities have also been provided within the premises.\nL291: These include an adventure park, an open barbeque area, community garden, pavilion, a swimming pool, perimeter fencing, playground, spa pool, and the list goes on. For people who love to keep themselves fit and healthy, a fitness corner, putting green, a gymnasium room with all updated pieces of equipment, roof terrace, and tennis courts have also been provided. Moreover, each residential unit has been provided with their own covered car park and aircon facilities which make living quite troublefree.\nL292: The community is also protected by a 24-hour security and surveillance team which maintains records of each visit and departure from the community to provide efficient security to its citizens. When it comes to transportation facilities, no other project can match the efficiency provided by Westside III. This is mainly because of the well-connected major highways and internal service roads which helps the residents to reach any adjoining place within minutes of driving time.\nL293: Roadways and railways are also a feasible option for daily travelers and commuters. The nearest KTM stations to the area are the Sungai Buloh KTM Station, Kepong Sentral KTM station, Segambut KTM station, KTM Taman Kepong, KTM Kepong Sentral (KA07), and the KTM Kepong (KA06). Furthermore, taxi services and bus rides are also very frequent in the area, thus, people can remain worry-free when it comes to transportation accessibility in the area.\nL294: Surrounded by many top-rated educational institutes, the place is the best place when it comes to staying. Many closest schools are the Taska Kiddies Patch, Aquasplash Academy, Sekolah Kebangsaan Bandar Sri Damansara 3, Smart Reader Kids, SMK Menjalara, and the Institut FMM. All these options are conveniently placed within a stone throw’s distance from the location.\nL295: Similarly, for entertainment purposes, the residents can visit the 7-11 The Waterfront @ Parkcity, The Waterfront, 99 Speedmart Flora which are known to be the best when it comes to doing shopping with affordable rates. Apart from these, many petrol stations, well-known hospitals like Parkcity Dental @ Waterfront, Leong Hoon Leok Acupuncure & Medical Center, many major banks, and more can be found.\nL296: The project has been created over a huge piece of land of about 4.27 acres, the project is a mini township of the Desa ParkCity. Consisting of about 47 storey and a total of 469 residential units, the average built-up size of the residential unit varies from 1,077sf to 1,927sf. Furthermore, the units have also been divided into six different layouts, namely, Type A1, Type A2, Type A3, Type B1, Type C1, and Type C2.\nL297: Each residential unit has been decorated using high-quality interiors with pre-approved air-conditioners. Similarly, each bathroom has also been provided with a hot water supply and shower screens. Besides this, an intercom has been provided to each residential unit for added security which is then directly connected to the security system.\nL298: While the sub-sale price of the units can vary from RM 899,999-RM 1,750,000, the rental charges, however, remain between RM 1-RM 1,068.Project Name: Westside IIIConfiguration: 469 residential unitsThe following developments are in the same neighbourhood as Westside III:The Westside OneOne Central Park @ Desa ParkCityThe Westside IIThe Northshore GardensThe BreezeWay Garden Condo\nL299: cite75†View project details L300: \nL301: cite76†4.8 3 Reviews L302: \nL303: cite77†Wei Chuen Pua IQI REALTY SDN. BHD. [ E (1) 1584 ] L304: \nL305: WhatsApp\nL306: \nL307: cite78†Image†cdn.pgimgs.com L308: \nL309: View Phone Number\nL310: \nL311: cite79†Image†cdn.pgimgs.com L312: \nL313: Send Enquiry\nL314: \nL315: By continuing, you agree to the cite80†Terms & cite81†Privacy Policy L316: ## FAQs\nL317: \nL318: ##### How much does it cost to buy a property in Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur?\nL319: \nL320: The unit for sale in Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur is RM 749,000.\nL321: \nL322: ##### Is security available at Westside Three?\nL323: \nL324: Yes (24 hours security).\nL325